ersion":"I have a history question."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1400.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30557","byteOffset":19440456,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_D32FECD9","articyId":"72057821671268532","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nellie Al-Zahiri","text":"Well I'm still a bit angry about the fragments you didn't hand over... disappointed rather. But...","speakerId":"Ntt_8918D3AD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well I'm still a bit angry about the fragments you didn't hand over... disappointed rather. But...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1900.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19598","byteOffset":15297136,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_DF310C18","articyId":"72057821671268553","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"What do you know about cryogenics in Nivalis?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What do you know about cryogenics in Nivalis?","TextSheVersion":"What do you know about cryogenics in Nivalis?","TextTheyVersion":"What do you know about cryogenics in Nivalis?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2000.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44149","byteOffset":31036760,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_C1E18AB7","articyId":"72057821671268560","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nellie Al-Zahiri","text":"Not as much as I would like to. Corporate cryogenics has long been shrouded in secrecy. Classified stuff.","speakerId":"Ntt_8918D3AD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not as much as I would like to. Corporate cryogenics has long been shrouded in secrecy. Classified stuff.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2300.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27197","byteOffset":18167544,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_F6289E77","articyId":"72057821671268567","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nellie Al-Zahiri","text":"The seventh epoch financial crisis seems to have affected the cryogenics industry.","speakerId":"Ntt_8918D3AD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The seventh epoch financial crisis seems to have affected the cryogenics industry.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2900.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25301","byteOffset":17456328,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_D116E45F","articyId":"72057821671268574","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nellie Al-Zahiri","text":"Records from that period are sparse because of the Erasera... But we know it was a bad time for just about everyone.","speakerId":"Ntt_8918D3AD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Records from that period are sparse because of the Erasera... But we know it was a bad time for just about everyone.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3200.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47045","byteOffset":32129352,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_32FE24FD","articyId":"72057821671268581","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nellie Al-Zahiri","text":"LifeCorp have never declassified their records from that time, even with high level Corp clearance.","speakerId":"Ntt_8918D3AD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"LifeCorp have never declassified their records from that time, even with high level Corp clearance.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3500.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37807","byteOffset":28638768,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_4F1A4067","articyId":"72057821671268588","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"Nothing?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nothing?","TextSheVersion":"Nothing?","TextTheyVersion":"Nothing?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3800.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24610","byteOffset":17187312,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_E68B66D6","articyId":"72057821671268595","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nellie Al-Zahiri","text":"I'm sorry. Even the names of those involved in the project are hard to find.","speakerId":"Ntt_8918D3AD","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm sorry. Even the names of those involved in the project are hard to find.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4100.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32097","byteOffset":20023544,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_18A26E9F","articyId":"72057821671272024","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"No, not yet. But I heard you are a historian.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No, not yet. But I heard you are a historian.","TextSheVersion":"No, not yet. But I heard you are a historian.","TextTheyVersion":"No, not yet. But I heard you are a historian."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1400.0,"y